# Calliope half of the nonlinear MRI production run behind Fig. 4 of
# COMPHY-D-26-00110.  The Gallope half is in
# gallope_dev/tests/MHD_INCOMP(MRI-production)/.
#
# Tracked: the run definition, the job script, the stdout log and this README.
# Untracked but present in the directory (Dropbox-backed): rms.dat, cfl.dat,
# the NetCDF diagnostics output, the final out2d/ snapshot and the figures
# generated from them.
#
# Deliberately not copied from Miyabi at all: restart/ (930 MB),
# calliope.modes.out (1.2 GB), and all but the last snapshot of out2d/ (4.2 GB
# there, 48 MB here -- see README.md).
*
!*/
__pycache__/
!.gitignore
!README.md
!*.in
!job.pbs-*
!out.std
